    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "In Flight with TWA...\nTWA'S\nSuper Constellation\nSKYLINER\nYou enjoy luxury living\naloft as you fly\nsmoothly in TWA's\ndependable, giant new\nSuper-Constellation\nSkyliners,\nthe latest word\nin swift, modern\npassenger aircraft.\nTWA\nTRANS WORLD AIRLINES\nU.S. A. EUROPE\nAF\n•ASIA\nTRANS",
      "Le luxe et la stabilité des nouveaux géants\nsuper-constellation de la TWA, rapides et\nmodernes, vous font mieux apprécier la joie de vivre dans le ciel.\nTWA\nPOST CARD\nVIA AIR MAIL\nPAR AVION\nPOSTAGE\nIN U. S.\n4¢\nCheck local Post\nOffice for postage\nto or from U. S.\nLitho in U. S. A.-005 8-52\n2002.113.466"
    ],
